  "runtime_rebuilt": false,
  "implementation": "The shared facade enables failure retention only after explicit development-policy/native-profile validation. The adapter retains exact request, response and initial verification bytes on a failed transport or no-act response. The existing native generic-receipt verifier and additional source identity, zero-velocity, error and unchanged-memory checks distinguish verified refusals from malformed responses. Both remain ok=false; no actuation value is returned and the adapter step clock/memory do not advance. The real facade early-return wrapper and unchanged worker partial-arm projection preserve those strings. Default/legacy paths remain disabled; ordinary native output is unchanged.",
